# env.optional — profile-feed extraction (both degrade; supply one).
# If APIFY_API_TOKEN is set -> Apify LinkedIn profile-posts actor (cookieless, primary).
# Else -> bundled Playwright degrade (li_profile_posts_playwright.mjs) with the LI_AT session
# cookie (the keyless default; lower throughput, needs npx playwright install chromium).
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# LinkedIn li_at session cookie for the keyless Playwright degrade
LI_AT
